window.SHALOM_BASE_TEXT["loz"] = {", Abuja, Nigeria. That heritage of fire on the prayer altar, sound scriptural teaching, and integrity continues to shape Shalom Embassy. The ministry also honours Bishop Dr. Edgar Ng'ambi for his fatherly counsel and apostolic blessing over the house.":", Abuja, Nigeria. Buneti bwa mollo fa altare ya kupupa, maluto a Mañolo a lukile, ni bunnete li sa bopa Shalom Embassy. Misebezi e fa bulemu kwa Bishop Dr. Edgar Ng'ambi ka likelezo za hae za bontata ni mubusiso wa bumutumwa fa ndu.",", Pastor Bupe is deeply committed to empowering and reaching vulnerable women and girls in villages across Zambia, leading them to Christ, and building churches in rural communities across the nation.":", Mubusisi Bupe u ikemiselitse hahulu ku fa maata ni ku fita kwa basali ni basizani ba ba sa silelezi mwa mikunda mwa Zambia kaufela, ku ba tambeka kwa Kreste, ni ku haha likereke mwa mikunda ya mwa masimu mwa naha kaufela.",", and":", ni",", and as digital downloads on":", ni sina daiwunilodi za dijitale kwa",", and co-author of the daily devotional":", ni mukwala ka kopanelo wa buka ya kupupa ya zazi ni zazi",", the LORD is peace. Together with all of its branch churches, Shalom Embassy recognises that the Word of God, the Holy Spirit, prayer, humility, and purity are foundational to building believers in the school of impact and greatness.":", MULENA ki kutula. Hamoho ni likereke kaufela za makalulo a yona, Shalom Embassy e ziba kuli Lizwi la Mulimu, Muya o Kenile, kupupa, boikokobetso, ni bukeñi ki musima wa ku haha balumeli mwa sikolo sa maata ni buhulu.",", this daily devotional introduces believers to deep, practical fellowship with the Person of the Holy Spirit. Written to enlarge your revelational capacity in the Word and prayer, every daily reading equips you to commune with the Spirit and walk in supernatural victory.":", buka ye ya kupupa ya zazi ni zazi e zibisa balumeli kwa kopano ye teile, ya kuitukela ni Mutu wa Muya o Kenile. E ngotilwe kuli i atise bokgoni bwa hao bwa ku amuhela litatubo mwa Lizwi ni kupupa; palo ni palo ya zazi i ku lukiisa ku kopana ni Muya ni ku pila mwa ku fenya ka maata a Mulimu.",". He resides in Lusaka with his wife, Pastor Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe, and together they are blessed with three sons: Jonathan, Will, and Yangeni.":". U pila mwa Lusaka ni musali wa hae, Mubusisi Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe, mi hamoho ba busisizwe ka bana ba bashimani ba balalu: Jonathan, Will, ni Yangeni.",". See the":". Bona",". We also have over 21 branches across Lusaka (including Mtendere, Mandevu, Matero, Foxdale, and Kanyama) and Chibombo.":". Lu na ni likalulo ze fita fa 21 mwa Lusaka kaufela (ku kenyeleza Mtendere, Mandevu, Matero, Foxdale, ni Kanyama) ni Chibombo.",". You can also watch replays anytime in our":". Mu ka bona hape ka nako ni nako mwa","06:00 CAT":"06:00 CAT","06:00 Morning Glory · Tue 14:00 Virtuous Women · First Friday 21:00 My Worship My Weapon 4":"06:00 Kanya ya Meso · Labubeli 14:00 Basali ba Likutezo · Labutanu ya Pele 21:00 My Worship My Weapon 4","07:00 — 14:00 CAT":"07:00 — 14:00 CAT","07:00 — 14:00 CAT · Quarterly":"07:00 — 14:00 CAT · Nako ni nako ya likweli tatu","11:00 & 16:00 CAT":"11:00 & 16:00 CAT","14:00 CAT":"14:00 CAT","17th Anniversary at Garden House HQ":"Ngambolo ya lilemo ze 17 kwa Garden House HQ","18:00 CAT":"18:00 CAT","2 Corinthians 9:7":"2 Corinthians 9:7","2010s":"2010s","21+ branches & a global online family":"Likalulo ze fita fa 21 ni lubasi lwa kwa inthanete lwa lifasi kaufela","21+ branches across Lusaka & Zambia":"Likalulo ze fita fa 21 mwa Lusaka ni Zambia","21:00 CAT":"21:00 CAT","21:00 — 04:00 CAT":"21:00 — 04:00 CAT","294K+":"294K+","55 messages":"Milaetsa ye 55","55 messages in library":"Milaetsa ye 55 mwa laiburari","7 Hours":"Lihola ze 7","7 Hours of Nothing Missing, Nothing Broken":"Lihola ze 7 za ku se na se si si teng ni se si twangilwe","9 Mar 2009":"9 Mar 2009","9 March 2009":"9 March 2009","A 16-hour worship encounter with Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe and guest minister Pst Washy. Watch the replay and enter again.":"Mukiti wa kulota wa lihola ze 16 ni Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe ni mubusisi yo muyeni Washy. Bona hape mi u kene hape.","A Sunday gathering in the Shalom Embassy main auditorium":"Kopano ya Sundaya mwa holo ye nkulu ya Shalom Embassy","A cheerful giver":"Mufi yo tabile","A day of consecration and seeking God together. Watch the replay and return to the altar with fresh hunger.":"Lizazi la ku i neela Mulimu ni ku batla Mulimu hamoho. Bona hape mi u kutele kwa altare ni talu ye ncha.","A family gathered":"Lubasi lo lo kopaneng","A family gathered in His presence":"Lubasi lo lo kopaneng mwa bupeto bwa Hae","A home for the family":"Ndu ya lubasi","A home of healing & deliverance":"Ndu ya kufolisa ni kululamisa","A home of healing and deliverance in Lusaka, Zambia, proclaiming the unconditional love of Jesus Christ through prayer, the Word, healing, and deliverance.":"Ndu ya kufolisa ni kululamisa mwa Lusaka, Zambia, ye e kalima lato la Jesu Kriste le li sa lekanyizwe ka kupupa, Lizwi, kufolisa, ni kululamisa.","A home where the broken become whole.":"Ndu mo ba ba twangilwe ba fola.","A house of prayer standing in the gap for families, leaders, and nations.":"Ndu ya kupupa ye e yema mwa likahare ka mabasi, baitapeleli, ni linaha.","A milestone of grace":"Siboniso sa butokwa sa ngawe","A night of prayer, praise, and freedom in Christ. Watch the replay and stand in the liberty Jesus purchased for you.":"Busihu bwa kupupa, ku boka, ni tokwahalo mwa Kreste. Bona hape mi u yeme mwa tokwahalo ye Jesu a u lekelize yona.","A note on integrity":"Mukwalo o mwafwi ka bunnete","A revived nation.":"Naha ye e pilihile.","A scriptural manual on identifying, confronting, and breaking recurring generational cycles, ungodly covenants, and stubborn patterns that resist progress in families and destinies—enforcing total liberty through the blood of Jesus and the anointing of the Holy Ghost.":"Buka ya ku luta ya Mañolo ka ku ziba ni ku lwana ni mikolo ye e boelelang ya mibelesi, likekano ze si za Mulimu, ni mikwa ye e tiyile ye e hanisa ku hula mwa mabasi ni bupilo bwa batu, ni ku li twanga—ku tiisa tokwahalo kaufela ka mali a Jesu ni kutoweswa kwa Muya o Kenile.","A seven-hour healing and deliverance service on the last Sunday of every month. Come expectant for worship, the Word, prophetic prayer, and ministry to the whole family.":"Misebezi ya kufolisa ni kululamisa ya lihola ze 7 ka Sundaya ya mafelelezo a kweli ni kweli. Taha u na ni sepo ka kulota, Lizwi, kupupa kwa buporofita, ni misebezi kwa lubasi kaufela.","A warm welcome":"Kamuhelo ye mofu","A weekly evening service dedicated to healing, deliverance, and restoration in spirit, soul, and body through the Word of God and the power of the Holy Spirit.":"Misebezi ya mishu ya viki ni viki ye e neelizwe kwa kufolisa, kululamisa, ni ku busulula mwa muya, mwa mupilu, ni mwa mubili ka Lizwi la Mulimu ni maata a Muya o Kenile.","A word for the people":"Lizwi kwa batu","A worship leader singing":"Mutapeleli wa kulota a bina","About":"Ka za luna","Action — Putting Faith to Work":"Kuitukela — Ku Sebelisa Tumelo","After serving for 17 years in a Pentecostal denomination, Apostle Sunday and Pastor Bupe Sinyangwe are released to establish Shalom Embassy Ministries International in Lusaka's Kanyama township.":"Kamulaho a ku sebeza lilemo ze 17 mwa kereke ya Pentekoste, Mutumwa Sunday ni Mubusisi Bupe Sinyangwe ba tululizwe ku bupa Shalom Embassy Ministries International mwa Kanyama, Lusaka.","All":"Kaufela","All 6 ministries":"Misebezi kaufela ye 6","All digital titles":"Libuka kaufela za dijitale","All messages":"Milaetsa kaufela","All times are Central Africa Time (CAT, UTC+2) at our Main Auditorium in Garden House, Lusaka.":"Nako kaufela ki Central Africa Time (CAT, UTC+2) kwa Holo ye Nkulu ya luna mwa Garden House, Lusaka.","Amazon Kindle":"Amazon Kindle","An all-night prophetic and deliverance vigil for answers, divine direction, and supernatural breakthrough in the presence of God.":"Kupupa kwa busihu kaufela kwa buporofita ni kululamisa ka ku batla likalabo, kutambekwa kwa Mulimu, ni ku fenya ka maata a Mulimu mwa bupeto bwa Mulimu.","An intercessory movement standing in the gap for families, leaders, and Zambia through Midnight Watch, dry fasts, and overnight vigils.":"Mukwaha wa kukupa o o yema mwa likahare ka mabasi, baitapeleli, ni Zambia ka Kulibelela kwa Mwakati wa Busihu, kuitima ka lijo ni mazi, ni mikupo ya busihu kaufela.","An interdenominational and church prayer network contending for families, leaders, and Zambia through Midnight Watch, Morning Glory, dry fasts, and overnight prayer vigils.":"Netiweke ya kupupa ya likereke ze ñwi ni ze ñwi ni ya kereke ye e lwanela mabasi, baitapeleli, ni Zambia ka Kulibelela kwa Mwakati wa Busihu, Kanya ya Meso, kuitima ka lijo ni mazi, ni mikupo ya busihu kaufela.","Apostle Dr. Sunday & Pastor Bupe Sinyangwe":"Mutumwa Dr. Sunday ni Mubusisi Bupe Sinyangwe","Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe":"Mutumwa Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe","Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe and Pastor Bupe Sinyangwe":"Mutumwa Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe ni Mubusisi Bupe Sinyangwe","Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe is the founder and vision carrier of Shalom Embassy Ministries International and The Standing In The Gap Team Prayer Ministry—a movement renowned across Zambia for intercession, overnight vigils, and deliverance. Called and anointed to preach the full Gospel of our Lord Jesus Christ, he is commissioned to take deliverance to the captives, victory to the victims of satanic and witchcraft oppression, strength to those weighed down by circumstances, and salvation to the lost.":"Mutumwa Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe ki mutami ni mutambeki wa pono wa Shalom Embassy Ministries International ni The Standing In The Gap Team Prayer Ministry—mukwaha o o zibahalileng mwa Zambia kaufela ka kukupa, mikupo ya busihu kaufela, ni kululamisa. U bizizwe ni ku toweswa ku kalima Mafu a Mande a felelang a Mulena wesu Jesu Kriste, mi u romilwe ku isa kululamisa kwa bafungwa, fenyo kwa batu ba e huparizwe ki Satani ni buloi, maata kwa ba ba lemelezizwe ki mikalo, ni puluso kwa ba lahile.","Apostle Sunday & Pastor Bupe":"Mutumwa Sunday ni Mubusisi Bupe","Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe":"Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe","Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe in prayer at Shalom Embassy":"Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe a kupupa kwa Shalom Embassy","Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe is a spiritual son of Dr. Pastor Paul Enenche of":"Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe ki mwana wa muya wa Dr. Mubusisi Paul Enenche wa","Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe leading prayer at Shalom Embassy":"Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe a tambeka kupupa kwa Shalom Embassy","Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe ministering the Word at Shalom Embassy":"Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe a kalima Lizwi kwa Shalom Embassy","Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe ministering to the Shalom Embassy congregation":"Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe a sebeza kwa batu ba kereke ya Shalom Embassy","Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe ministering to the congregation":"Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe a sebeza kwa batu ba kereke","Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe preaching at Shalom Embassy":"Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe a kalima kwa Shalom Embassy","Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe preaching in the main auditorium":"Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe a kalima mwa holo ye nkulu","Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe, founder and president of Shalom Embassy Ministries International":"Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe, mutami ni mubusisi yo nkulu wa Shalom Embassy Ministries International","Apostle Sunday and Pastor Bupe Sinyangwe":"Mutumwa Sunday ni Mubusisi Bupe Sinyangwe","Are children and youths catered for?":"Kana bana ni bashimani ba babalelwa?","Aug 24, 2026":"Aug 24, 2026","Aug 27, 2026":"Aug 27, 2026","Aug 4, 2026":"Aug 4, 2026","Available as an instant digital download on Selar and in print at the Shalom Embassy bookshop in Lusaka.":"E fumaneha sina daiwunilodi ya dijitale ya nako ye kwa Selar ni mwa buka e hatisizwe kwa ndu ya libuka ya Shalom Embassy mwa Lusaka.","Back to top":"Kutela kwa halimu","Battle Axe Youth":"Bashimani ba Battle Axe","Become a partner":"Iba sipapati","Begin each morning at the altar of prayer with Morning Glory and Standing In The Gap intercession, committing your family, work, and nation into God's hands.":"Kala meso ni meso fa altare ya kupupa ni Kanya ya Meso ni kukupa kwa Standing In The Gap, u neela lubasi lwa hao, misebezi, ni naha mwa matata a Mulimu.","Better together":"Hamoho ki buino","Big Sunday":"Sundaya ye Nkulu","Books":"Libuka","Books & prayer manuals.":"Libuka ni buka za kupupa.","Books section":"Kalulo ya libuka","Branches in Zambia":"Likalulo mwa Zambia","Breadcrumb":"Njila","Browse all messages":"Talima milaetsa kaufela","Building and maintaining a place where every person can encounter God and belong.":"Ku haha ni ku boloka sibaka mo mutu kaufela a ka kopana ni Mulimu ni ku ba wa hao.","Building fund & projects":"Mali a ku haha ni misebezi","Building men of faith, godly character, spiritual authority, and purposeful leadership in their homes, workplaces, and communities.":"Ku haha banna ba tumelo, mukwa o swanela Mulimu, maata a muya, ni bubusi bo bu na ni mubako mwa mandu a bona, mwa mibaka ya misebezi, ni mwa mikunda ya bona.","Built for wholeness.":"E ahilwe ka bupilo bo bu felela.","By Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe":"Ki Mutumwa Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe","By Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe · Shalom Library":"Ki Mutumwa Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe · Laiburari ya Shalom","By Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe · Standing In The Gap Team (73 pp.)":"Ki Mutumwa Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe · Sikwata sa Standing In The Gap (litatole ze 73)","By sending a message you agree that our team may contact you to respond. We do not share your details with third parties.":"Ka ku lumela mulaetsa u dumela kuli sikwata sa luna si ka ku ikopanya ni wena ku u alaba. Ha lu abelani lika za hao ni batu ba bañwi.","CAT":"CAT","Call daily for prayer, counsel, and enquiries":"Bizanga zazi ni zazi ka kupupa, likelezo, ni mibuzo","Call our Standing In The Gap prayer line or message us on WhatsApp—our pastors and intercessors are ready to agree with you in prayer.":"Bizanga foni ya kupupa ya Standing In The Gap kamba lu lumelele mulaetsa kwa WhatsApp—babusisi ni bakupi ba luna ba lukile ku dumelana ni wena mwa kupupa.","Call our daily prayer line for prayer and counsel, and join us for special Friday Night of Freedom and Standing In The Gap overnight vigils.":"Bizanga foni ya kupupa ya luna ya zazi ni zazi ka kupupa ni likelezo, mi u kopane ni luna kwa Busihu bwa Tokwahalo bwa Labutanu ni mikupo ya busihu kaufela ya Standing In The Gap.","Call the prayer line":"Bizanga foni ya kupupa","Called, appointed, and anointed to equip the saints in the Word, prayer, humility, and purity.":"U bizizwe, u kethilwe, ni ku toweswa ku lukiisa bakale mwa Lizwi, kupupa, boikokobetso, ni bukeñi.","Can I watch services live online?":"Kana ni ka bona misebezi ya pili kwa inthanete?","Catch up on the gatherings and encounters that marked our year. Every replay is a chance to receive what God said.":"Fumana hape mikopano ni mikiti ye e bile ni mokuna mwa silimo sa luna. Ku bona hape kaufela ki sibaka sa ku amuhela se Mulimu a se buile.","Chat on WhatsApp":"Ambola kwa WhatsApp","Chat with Shalom Embassy on WhatsApp":"Ambola ni Shalom Embassy kwa WhatsApp","Chat with the church office":"Ambola ni ofisi ya kereke","Choose your way to sow.":"Keta njila ya hao ya ku jala.","Church calendar":"Kalenda ya kereke","Close photo viewer":"Kwala sibonisi sa lifoto","Co-Author & President of Virtuous Women Ministry":"Mukwala ka kopanelo ni Mubusisi yo Nkulu wa Misebezi ya Basali ba Likutezo","Co-Founder · President of Virtuous Women Ministry":"Mutami ka kopanelo · Mubusisi yo Nkulu wa Misebezi ya Basali ba Likutezo","Co-author of":"Mukwala ka kopanelo wa","Co-authored by":"E ngotilwe ka kopanelo ki","Come and see":"Taha u bone","Come and worship with us. Bring your family, bring your questions, bring your expectation.":"Taha u lotuze ni luna. Tisa lubasi lwa hao, tisa mibuzo ya hao, tisa sepo ya hao.","Come as you are. Leave whole.":"Taha sina u i nzi. Zwa u pila kaufela.","Come expecting.":"Taha u na ni sepo.","Come forward for prayer after the message; we will stand with you in faith.":"Taha fa pele ka kupupa kamulaho a mulaetsa; lu ka yema ni wena ka tumelo.","Commissioned in Kanyama, Lusaka":"E romilwe kwa Kanyama, Lusaka","Conference":"Mukopano wo Nkulu","Congregants receiving prayer and ministry at Shalom Embassy":"Batu ba kereke ba amuhela kupupa ni misebezi kwa Shalom Embassy","Connect with Virtuous Women":"Kopana ni Basali ba Likutezo","Connect with us throughout the week at Shalom Embassy Headquarters in Garden House, Lusaka, and across our 21+ branch churches.":"Kopana ni luna mwa viki kaufela kwa Shalom Embassy Headquarters mwa Garden House, Lusaka, ni kwa likereke za luna ze fita fa 21 za makalulo.","Consecration":"Ku i neela Mulimu","Contact":"Kukopanya","Contact & Visit | Shalom Embassy Ministries International":"Kukopanya ni Ku Etela | Shalom Embassy Ministries International","Contact & visit":"Kukopanya ni ku etela","Daily & Friday Vigils":"Mikupo ya Busihu ya Zazi ni Zazi ni ya Labutanu","Daily theme & anchor Scripture":"Mubako wa zazi ni Mañolo a musima","Date to be announced":"Lizazi li ka zibiswa","Dates to save.":"Mazazi a ku boloka.","Dealing With Evil Patterns":"Ku Lwana ni Mikwa e Mibi","Dealing With Evil Patterns book cover by Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe":"Sikwalo sa buka ya Ku Lwana ni Mikwa e Mibi ki Mutumwa Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe","Deliverance & spiritual warfare":"Kululamisa ni ndwa ya muya","Deliverance Ministry":"Misebezi ya Kululamisa","Details":"Makande","Discover opportunities to grow in the Word, intercede in prayer, and serve alongside believers across our fellowships.":"Fumana mibaka ya ku hula mwa Lizwi, ku kupa mwa kupupa, ni ku sebeza hamoho ni balumeli mwa makopano a luna.","Divine healing and deliverance are available today through the power of Jesus Christ.":"Kufolisa kwa Mulimu ni kululamisa li fumaneha kacenu ka maata a Jesu Kriste.","Divine healing, deliverance & restoration":"Kufolisa kwa Mulimu, kululamisa ni ku busulula","Don't Stagger at His Promise":"U Se Ke Wa Tekateka fa Silekano sa Hae","Don't just watch. Belong.":"U Se Ke Wa Bona Fela. Iba Wa Ndu.","Dunamis International Gospel Centre":"Dunamis International Gospel Centre","Empowerment Sunday":"Sundaya ya Kufa Maata","Empowerment Sunday on the first Sunday of every month (07:00 — 14:00 CAT), My Worship My Weapon 4 on the first Friday (21:00 CAT), and Big Sunday quarterly.":"Sundaya ya Kufa Maata ka Sundaya ya pele ya kweli ni kweli (07:00 — 14:00 CAT), My Worship My Weapon 4 ka Labutanu ya pele (21:00 CAT), ni Sundaya ye Nkulu nako ni nako ya likweli tatu.","Empowerment Sunday, My Worship My Weapon 4 & Big Sunday":"Sundaya ya Kufa Maata, My Worship My Weapon 4 ni Sundaya ye Nkulu","Equipping young men and women to discover their identity, purity, and calling in Christ through Sunday youth services, the Battle Axe Conference, and ROAR worship encounters.":"Ku lukiisa bashimani ni basizani ku fumana se ba i li sona, bukeñi, ni mubizo wa bona mwa Kreste ka misebezi ya bashimani ya Sundaya, Mukopano wo Nkulu wa Battle Axe, ni mikiti ya kulota ya ROAR.","Every Last Sunday":"Sundaya ya mafelelezo a kweli ni kweli","Every Last Sunday · 07:00 — 14:00":"Sundaya ya mafelelezo a kweli ni kweli · 07:00 — 14:00","Every Sunday gathering, Night of Solution, and special encounter is streamed for the family scattered across the nations. Subscribe and turn on notifications so you never miss a word.":"Kopano ni kopano ya Sundaya, Busihu bwa Kululamisa, ni mikiti ye iketileng e hasiwa ka inthanete ka lubasi lo lo hasaneng mwa linaha. Ingolisa ni ku bula mataluso kuli u se ke wa siwa ki lizwi.","Every Thursday":"Labune ni Labune","Every Tuesday":"Labubeli ni Labubeli","Every Wednesday":"Labulalu ni Labulalu","Every gift carries a story.":"Sipimo kaufela se si na ni mulaetsa.","Every gift has a place.":"Sipho ni sipho se na ni sibaka sa sona.","Every gift is an act of faith — a seed sown into the lives of people, the work of the Gospel, and the future of this house.":"Sipho ni sipho ki musebezi wa tumelo — peo ye byalilwe mwa bupilo bwa batu, mwa misebezi ya Mafu a Nde, ni mwa nako ye e taha ya ndu ye.","Every seed sown supports the preaching of the Word, humanitarian outreach to vulnerable women and families, rural church planting in villages across Zambia, and the Shalom TV broadcast ministry.":"Peo ni peo ye byalilwe i thusa ku bolela Lizwi la Mulimu, ku fa thuso kwa basali ni malapa a ba ba hlokang, ku byala likereke kwa mikunda ya mwahae mwa Zambia kaufela, ni musebezi wa ku kalisa wa Shalom TV.","Everyday With The Holy Spirit":"Zazi ni Zazi ni Muya o Kenile","Everyday With The Holy Spirit Daily Devotional by Apostle Dr. Sunday and Pastor Bupe Sinyangwe":"Zazi ni Zazi ni Muya o Kenile — bukana ya ku bala ya zazi ni zazi ka Mutumwa Dr. Sunday ni Mubusisi Bupe Sinyangwe","Everyday With The Holy Spirit — full book jacket with author biographies (ISBN 978-9982-50-107-9)":"Zazi ni Zazi ni Muya o Kenile — kovero ya buku kaufela ni litaba za bupilo bwa babupi (ISBN 978-9982-50-107-9)","Executing Judgment on the Spirit of Jezebel":"Ku Atula Muya wa Jezebel","Explore":"Bona","Explore Battle Axe Youth":"Bona Battle Axe Youth","Explore Virtuous Women":"Bona Basali ba Likutezo","Facebook":"Facebook","Featured daily devotional · ISBN 978-9982-50-107-9":"Bukana ya ku bala ya zazi ni zazi ye e ketilwe · ISBN 978-9982-50-107-9","Featured message":"Molaetsa o ketilwe","Fill in the form and it will open WhatsApp with your message ready to send. You can also call the prayer line directly.":"Twalisa fomo, mi i ka bula WhatsApp ni molaetsa wa hao o lokiselitswe ku romelelwa. U ka kona ni ku bizanga foni ya kupupa ka kotoka.","Filter by the kind of message you need. Every message is available on our YouTube channel.":"Keta ka muhata wa molaetsa o o hlokang. Molaetsa kaufela u fumaneha kwa YouTube ya luna.","Filter messages by category":"Keta molaetsa ka muhata.","Financial Overflow":"Mali a Fetuhile","Find a word for your season.":"Fumana lizwi la nako ya hao.","Find us":"Lu fumane","Find your people, grow your gift, and serve the purpose of God with us.":"Fumana batu ba hao, hulisa sipho sa hao, mi u sebeze morero wa Mulimu ni luna.","Find your place. Serve with purpose.":"Fumana sibaka sa hao. Sebeza ka morero.","Fire Burning":"Mollo o Tukile","First Sunday 07:00 — 14:00 · First Friday 21:00 CAT":"Sundaya ya Pele 07:00 — 14:00 · Labutanu ya Pele 21:00 CAT","First Week & Quarterly":"Viki ya Pele ni Likweli Tatu","First Week of Every Month":"Viki ya pele ya kweli ni kweli","First time?":"U Taha Kalelo?","First week · Empowerment Sunday & My Worship My Weapon 4":"Viki ya Pele · Sundaya ya Kufa Maata ni My Worship My Weapon 4","Focus":"Muhupulo","Follow along":"Latelela ni luna","Follow on TikTok":"Latelela kwa TikTok","Follow us":"Lu latele","Founded 9 March 2009 · Lusaka, Zambia":"Ye e bupilwe ka 9 Machi 2009 · Lusaka, Zambia","Founded by Pastor Bupe Sinyangwe to raise a Spirit-filled army of watchmen, equipping women in prayer, teaching, family leadership, and rural outreach across Zambia.":"Ye e bupilwe ki Mubusisi Bupe Sinyangwe kuli a pahamise sikwata sa basole ba balindi ba ba tladilwe ki Muya o Kenile, a lukiise basali mwa kupupa, kuluta, bueteli bwa lapa, ni thuso kwa mikunda ya mwahae mwa Zambia kaufela.","Founded on 9 March 2009 by Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe and Pastor Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe after seventeen years of faithful service in Pentecostal ministry, Shalom Embassy Ministries International began in Lusaka's Kanyama area and now serves from our headquarters at Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road, with over 21 branches across Zambia.":"Ye e bupilwe ka 9 Machi 2009 ki Mutumwa Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe ni Mubusisi Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe ka mora lilimo ze 17 za musebezi o o tiyileng mwa bushomi bwa Pentekoste, Shalom Embassy Ministries International i kalile kwa Kanyama mwa Lusaka, mi hainu i sebeza ku zwa kwa ofisi e nkulu ya luna kwa Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road, ni makalulo a fetang 21 mwa Zambia kaufela.","Founded on 9 March 2009 to see lives restored to wholeness.":"Ye e bupilwe ka 9 Machi 2009 kuli lu bone bupilo bu folisizwe mi bu lulamisiwe.","Founder & President":"Mubupi ni Mupuresidente","Founders":"Babupi","Fresh from the family.":"Ze ncha ku zwa kwa lubasi.","From Kanyama to Garden House and 21+ branches across Zambia, every chapter has been sustained by prayer and grace.":"Ku zwa Kanyama ku ya kwa Garden House ni makalulo a fetang 21 mwa Zambia kaufela, karolo ni karolo ya pale ye i tiyisizwe ki kupupa ni ngawe.","From its beginnings in Kanyama, the church has grown into a movement with its headquarters at":"Ku zwa kwa makalilo a yona kwa Kanyama, kereke i hulile mi i ata, mi i na ni ofisi ya yona e nkulu kwa","From the moment you arrive, our team will help you find your way and settle in.":"Fa u fihile fela, sikwata sa luna si ka ku thusa ku fumana tsela ya hao ni ku itamela hande.","Full Sunday and midweek services, monthly 7-hour healing and deliverance encounters, prophetic prayer vigils, worship encounters, and published books from Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe and Pastor Bupe Sinyangwe.":"Misebezi kaufela ya Sundaya ni ya mwakati wa viki, mikopano ya kufolisa ni kululamisa ya lihora ze 7 kweli ni kweli, kupupa kwa busihu kwa boporofita, mikopano ya kulotuza, ni libuka ze phatlaladitsweng ku zwa kwa Mutumwa Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe ni Mubusisi Bupe Sinyangwe.","Full weekly schedule":"Lenaneo kaufela la viki","Gather":"Mikopano","Gather with us":"Kopana ni luna","Gathering at the Main Auditorium at Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road, the church celebrates 17 years of grace, growth, healing, and deliverance alongside guest minister Bishop Dr. Edgar Ng'ambi.":"Kopano i ba kwa Main Auditorium kwa Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road, mi kereke i keteka lilimo ze 17 za ngawe, kuhula, kufolisa, ni kululamisa hamoho ni mubusisi wa baeti Bishop Dr. Edgar Ng'ambi.","Gatherings":"Mikopano","Gatherings & Services | Shalom Embassy Ministries International":"Mikopano ni Misebezi | Shalom Embassy Ministries International","Get connected":"Ikopanye","Get directions":"Fumana tsela","Get directions on Google Maps":"Fumana tsela kwa Google Maps","Get in touch":"Ikopanye ni luna","Get on Selar":"Reka kwa Selar","Give":"Kufa","Give towards tithes, offerings, missions, rural outreach, and the building fund. Contact the church office via WhatsApp or phone for verified bank and mobile money channels.":"Fa lishumi, mikelo, misebezi ya Mafu, thuso kwa mikunda ya mwahae, ni mali a kuyaka ndu. Ikopanye ni ofisi ya kereke ka WhatsApp kamba foni kuli u fumane mabanki a tiyisizwe ni mikwa ya mali ya foni.","Giving & Partnership | Shalom Embassy Ministries International":"Kufa ni Bukopani | Shalom Embassy Ministries International","Giving & partnership":"Kufa ni bukopani","Giving is":"Kufa ki","Glimpses of what God is doing in our family — from Sunday worship to moments of prayer and celebration.":"Mipono ya se Mulimu a se eza mwa lubasi lwa luna — ku zwa kwa kulotuza kwa Sundaya ku ya kwa mikiti ya kupupa ni ya ku keteka.","Good to know":"Se si nde ku se ziba","Happening now - you are welcome":"Ze e ba hainu - u amuhelwa","He is the author of the quarterly":"Ki yena muñoli wa buku ya likweli tatu.","Healing & Deliverance":"Kufolisa ni Kululamisa","Healing & Deliverance Service":"Musebezi wa Kufolisa ni Kululamisa","Healing & deliverance":"Kufolisa ni kululamisa","Healing and Deliverance Service":"Musebezi wa Kufolisa ni Kululamisa","Healing and deliverance for the spirit, soul, and body through Jesus Christ.":"Kufolisa ni kululamisa kwa muya, bupilo, ni mubili ka Jesu Kreste.","Heartfelt, Spirit-led worship that makes room for the presence of God.":"Kulotuza kwa ku zwa mwa pilu, ko ku etelwa ki Muya, ku sisa sibaka kuli Mulimu a be teng.","Helping us show the love of Christ in practical ways to people who need hope and support.":"Ku lu thusa ku bontisa lato lwa Kreste ka mikwa e e bonahalang kwa batu ba ba hlokang sepo ni thuso.","Home":"Kwa Hae","Honour the Lord with your tithe and offering (Malachi 3:10) to sustain the daily ministry of the Word, prayer, and deliverance at Shalom Embassy.":"Kanya Mulena ka lishumi ni mukelo wa hao (Malachi 3:10) kuli u tiyise musebezi wa zazi ni zazi wa Lizwi la Mulimu, kupupa, ni kululamisa kwa Shalom Embassy.","How can I order the Jubilee Prayer Book or Everyday With The Holy Spirit?":"Ni ka fumana cwani Buku ya Kupupa ya Jubilee kamba Zazi ni Zazi ni Muya o Kenile?","How can we pray with you?":"Lu ka kupupa ni wena cwani?","How should we reach you?":"Lu ka ikopanya ni wena cwani?","ISBN 978-9982-51-209-1":"ISBN 978-9982-51-209-1","If you have any questions about giving, partnership, or a special project, our team is ready to help.":"Ha u na ni lipotso ka za kufa, bukopani, kamba musebezi o o kgethehileng, sikwata sa luna si ikemiselitse ku thusa.","In March 2026, the Shalom Embassy family gathered to celebrate 17 years of ministry — 17 years of healing, deliverance, provision, and lives made whole. We give God all the glory, and we are believing Him for the next chapter.":"Mwa Machi 2026, lubasi lwa Shalom Embassy lu kopanile ku keteka lilimo ze 17 za musebezi — lilimo ze 17 za kufolisa, kululamisa, ku fa, ni bupilo bo bu folisizwe. Lu fa Mulimu bulemu kaufela, mi lu mu tshepa kwa karolo ye e taha ya pale.","Instagram":"Instagram","Intercession · ISBN 978-9982-51-209-1":"Kupupa kwa Batu ba Bañwi · ISBN 978-9982-51-209-1","January February March April May June July August September October November December":"Januari Februari Machi Aprili Mei Juni Julai Agosti Septemba Oktoba Novemba Disemba","Jehovah Shalom":"Jehovah Shalom","Join the brotherhood":"Kopana ni banna ba luna","Join the prayer team":"Kopana ni sikwata sa kupupa","Join us at our Main Auditorium in Garden House, Lusaka, for the monthly 7 Hours healing and deliverance service, quarterly Big Sunday, Monday–Saturday Morning Glory, Tuesday Virtuous Women, Wednesday Midweek Service and Night of Solution, Thursday Healing & Deliverance, and our first-week Empowerment Sunday and My Worship My Weapon 4 encounters.":"Kopana ni luna kwa Main Auditorium ya luna kwa Garden House, Lusaka, kwa musebezi wa kufolisa ni kululamisa wa Lihora ze 7 wa kweli ni kweli, Sundaya ye Nkulu ya likweli tatu, Kanya ya Meso ya Mubulo–Labukweli, Basali ba Likutezo ka Labubeli, Misebezi ya Mwakati wa Viki ni Busihu bwa Kululamisa ka Labulalu, Kufolisa ni Kululamisa ka Labune, ni mikopano ya luna ya Sundaya ya Kufa Maata ni My Worship My Weapon 4 ya viki ya pele.","Join us this Sunday, or reach out and let us pray with you. We would love to meet you.":"Kopana ni luna Sundaya ye, kamba u ikopanye ni luna mi lu kupupe ni wena. Lu ka lata ku kopana ni wena.","Jubilee Prayer Book":"Buku ya Kupupa ya Jubilee","Jubilee Prayer Book Series":"Seti ya Libuka za Kupupa za Jubilee","Jubilee Prayer Book — Executing Judgment on the Spirit of Jezebel by Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe":"Buku ya Kupupa ya Jubilee — Ku Atula Muya wa Jezebel ka Mutumwa Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe","Judges 6:24":"Judges 6:24","Jul 16, 2015":"16 Julai 2015","Jul 19, 2026":"19 Julai 2026","Keeping The":"Ku Boloka","Last Sunday 07:00 — 14:00 CAT · Wednesdays 11:00, 16:00 & 21:00 CAT · Thursdays 18:00 CAT":"Sundaya ya Mafelelezo 07:00 — 14:00 CAT · Labulalu 11:00, 16:00 ni 21:00 CAT · Labune 18:00 CAT","Last Sunday 07:00 — 14:00 · Big Sunday quarterly 07:00 — 14:00 · Empowerment Sunday 07:00 — 14:00":"Sundaya ya Mafelelezo 07:00 — 14:00 · Sundaya ye Nkulu ya likweli tatu 07:00 — 14:00 · Sundaya ya Kufa Maata 07:00 — 14:00","Last Sunday · 7 Hours 07:00 — 14:00":"Sundaya ya Mafelelezo · Lihora ze 7 07:00 — 14:00","Last synced":"Ye nchafaditsweng mafelelezo","Latest across our channels":"Ze ncha kwa mikwa kaufela ya luna ya media","Latest from Shalom":"Ze ncha ku zwa kwa Shalom","Latest from our social channels":"Ze ncha ku zwa kwa mikwa ya luna ya social media","Latest moments":"Mikiti ye ncha","Leadership":"Bueteli","Leading the house into God's presence through anointed music and media while laying a strong biblical foundation for children in the family.":"Ku etela ndu kwa bupo bwa Mulimu ka muzika ni media ze tlodilweng, mi ka nako ye swana ku bea mutheo o o tiyileng wa Bibele kwa bana ba mwa lubasi.","Leave whole.":"Zwa u folile.","Led by Pastor Bupe Sinyangwe to raise a Spirit-filled army of watchmen, equipping women in Lusaka and villages across Zambia.":"Ye e etelwa ki Mubusisi Bupe Sinyangwe kuli a pahamise sikwata sa basole ba balindi ba ba tladilwe ki Muya o Kenile, a lukiise basali kwa Lusaka ni mikunda ya Zambia kaufela.","Led by Pastor Bupe Sinyangwe, equipping women through fervent intercession, practical teaching of the Word, fellowship, and spiritual mentorship.":"Ye e etelwa ki Mubusisi Bupe Sinyangwe, e lukiisa basali ka kupupa kwa maata kwa batu bañwi, kuluta Lizwi ka mikwa e e bonahalang, kopano, ni ku luta kwa muya.","Let us stand with you in prayer.":"Ha lu yeme ni wena mwa kupupa.","Life at Shalom":"Bupilo kwa Shalom","Load more messages":"Bona milaetsa ye ñwi","Luke 4:18":"Luke 4:18","Lusaka, Zambia":"Lusaka, Zambia","Lusaka, Zambia · Founded 9 March 2009":"Lusaka, Zambia · Ye e bupilwe ka 9 Machi 2009","Main Auditorium & Online Broadcast":"Main Auditorium ni Ku Kalisa kwa Inthaneti","Main Auditorium · Plot 995, Garden House":"Main Auditorium · Plot 995, Garden House","Main Auditorium · Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road":"Main Auditorium · Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road","Making Your Life Count":"Ku Eza Kuli Bupilo Bwa Hao Bu Balwe","Map of Garden House and Mumbwa Road in Lusaka showing Shalom Embassy Ministries International":"Mapa wa Garden House ni Mumbwa Road kwa Lusaka o o bontisa Shalom Embassy Ministries International","Mar 2026":"Machi 2026","Media & broadcast":"Media ni ku kalisa","Meet our leaders":"Kopana ni baeteli ba luna","Members of the congregation listening to the Word":"Batu ba kereke ba mamela Lizwi la Mulimu","Men and leaders gathered in the Word at Shalom Embassy":"Banna ni baeteli ba kopanile mwa Lizwi kwa Shalom Embassy","Men's Fellowship":"Kopano ya Banna","Men's Ministry":"Musebezi wa Banna","Messages archived":"Milaetsa ye e bolokilweng","Messages are a gift, but transformation happens in the family. Join us in person this Sunday.":"Milaetsa ki sipho, kono kufetuka ku fumanwa mwa lubasi. Kopana ni luna ka mubili Sundaya ye.","Messages shared":"Milaetsa ye e abilweng","Messages that":"Milaetsa ye e","Messages that anchor the soul.":"Milaetsa ye e tiyisa muya.","Midweek & Overnight":"Mwakati wa Viki ni Busihu","Midweek Service":"Misebezi ya Mwakati wa Viki","Midweek Service & Night of Solution":"Misebezi ya Mwakati wa Viki ni Busihu bwa Kululamisa","Midweek Service on Wednesday at 11:00 and 16:00 CAT, Night of Solution from 21:00 to 04:00 CAT, and Healing & Deliverance on Thursday at 18:00 CAT.":"Misebezi ya Mwakati wa Viki ka Labulalu ka 11:00 ni 16:00 CAT, Busihu bwa Kululamisa ku zwa ka 21:00 ku ya ka 04:00 CAT, ni Kufolisa ni Kululamisa ka Labune ka 18:00 CAT.","Midweek, Night of Solution & Healing":"Mwakati wa Viki, Busihu bwa Kululamisa ni Kufolisa","Ministering healing, freedom from oppression, and restoration in spirit, soul, and body through the Word of God and the power of the Holy Ghost.":"Ku sebeza kufolisa, kutokwa mwa kubeta, ni kubuyiswa kwa muya, bupilo, ni mubili ka Lizwi la Mulimu ni maata a Muya o Kenile.","Ministries":"Misebezi ya Mulimu","Miracle Service":"Musebezi wa Mikuzu","Missed a gathering or need a word for the road? Catch up on recent messages from Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe.":"Ha u ka siya kopano kamba u hloka lizwi la tsela? Bona milaetsa ye ncha ku zwa kwa Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe.","Mission, vision, and mandate.":"Mosebezi, pono, ni taelo.","Missions & partnership":"Misebezi ya Mafu ni Bukopani","Moments of grace.":"Mikiti ya ngawe.","Moments we will not forget.":"Mikiti ye lu ka se e lebale.","Monday – Saturday":"Mubulo – Labukweli","Monthly & quarterly encounters":"Mikopano ya kweli ni kweli ni ya likweli tatu","Mon–Sat Morning Glory, Tue Virtuous Women & First Week":"Mubulo–Labukweli Kanya ya Meso, Labubeli Basali ba Likutezo ni Viki ya Pele","Mon–Sat · Morning Glory 06:00":"Mubulo–Labukweli · Kanya ya Meso 06:00","Morning Glory":"Kanya ya Meso","My Worship My Weapon 3.0":"My Worship My Weapon 3.0","My Worship My Weapon 3.0 worship encounter":"Mukopano wa kulotuza wa My Worship My Weapon 3.0","My Worship My Weapon 3.0 worship encounter poster":"Posita ya mukopano wa kulotuza wa My Worship My Weapon 3.0","My Worship My Weapon 4":"My Worship My Weapon 4","New frames from the family.":"Lifoto ze ncha ku zwa kwa lubasi.","New moments, messages, and updates from our church family — pulled automatically from our channels.":"Mikiti, milaetsa, ni litaba ze ncha ku zwa kwa lubasi lwa kereke ya luna — ze e gutwazwe ka boikemelo ku zwa kwa mikwa ya luna ya media.","Next month":"Kweli ye e taha","Next monthly Sunday service in":"Musebezi wa Sundaya wa kweli ni kweli o o taha mwa","Next photo":"Foto ye e taha","Night of Freedom":"Busihu bwa Kutokwa","Night of Freedom prayer gathering":"Kopano ya kupupa ya Busihu bwa Kutokwa","Night of Solution":"Busihu bwa Kululamisa","Night of Solution gathering poster":"Posita ya kopano ya Busihu bwa Kululamisa","Nothing broken.":"Ha ku na se si bukile.","Nothing missing, nothing broken (Judges 6:24). We are commissioned to take deliverance to the captives, strength to the weary, restoration to the backslidden, and salvation to the lost.":"Ha ku na se si siyo, ha ku na se si bukile (Judges 6:24). Lu lumeletswe ku isa kululamisa kwa bafungiwa, maata kwa ba ba lobile, kubuyiswa kwa ba ba filikile kwa morago, ni puluso kwa ba ba lahlehile.","Nothing missing.":"Ha ku na se si siyo.","Nothing missing. Nothing broken.":"Ha ku na se si siyo. Ha ku na se si bukile.","Nov 1, 2026":"1 Novemba 2026","November 2026":"Njimwana 2026","Oct 18, 2026":"Yenda 18, 2026","Oct 22, 2026":"Yenda 22, 2026","Oct 23, 2026":"Yenda 23, 2026","Oct 25, 2026":"Yenda 25, 2026","Oct 26, 2026":"Yenda 26, 2026","Official bookshop on Selar":"Sibaka sa semmuso sa ku rekisa libuka kwa Selar","Official feeds":"Litaba za semmuso","On Sundays, we gather for the 7 Hours of Nothing Missing, Nothing Broken healing and deliverance service on the last Sunday of every month (07:00 to 14:00 CAT), Big Sunday quarterly, and Empowerment Sunday on the first Sunday of every month (07:00 to 14:00 CAT). During the week, Morning Glory holds Monday to Saturday at 06:00 CAT, Virtuous Women meets Tuesdays at 14:00 CAT, Midweek Service holds Wednesdays at 11:00 and 16:00 CAT, Night of Solution holds Wednesday nights from 21:00 to 04:00 CAT, and Healing & Deliverance holds Thursdays at 18:00 CAT. My Worship My Weapon 4 holds on the first Friday of every month at 21:00 CAT.":"Ka Sundaya ni Sundaya, lu kopana kwa Misebezi ya Kufolisa ni Kululamisa ya Lihora ze 7 ya Ha Ku Na Se Si Siyo, Ha Ku Na Se Si Bukile ka Sundaya ya mafelelezo a kweli ni kweli (07:00 ku fita 14:00 CAT), Sundaya ye Nkulu ya likweli tatu, ni Sundaya ya Kufa Maata ka Sundaya ya pele ya kweli ni kweli (07:00 ku fita 14:00 CAT). Mwa viki, Kanya ya Meso i kopana Mubulo ku fita Labukweli ka 06:00 CAT, Basali ba Likutezo ba kopana ka Labubeli ka 14:00 CAT, Misebezi ya Mwakati wa Viki i kopana ka Labulalu ka 11:00 ni 16:00 CAT, Busihu bwa Kululamisa bu kopana ka busihu bwa Labulalu ku zwa 21:00 ku fita 04:00 CAT, mi Kufolisa ni Kululamisa li kopana ka Labune ka 18:00 CAT. My Worship My Weapon 4 i kopana ka Labutanu ya pele ya kweli ni kweli ka 21:00 CAT.","One God":"Mulimu u li mong","Online family":"Lubasi lwa kwa intaneti","Open":"Bula","Open Heaven — Part 1":"Lihalimu ze Bulehilwe — Karolo 1","Open in Maps":"Bula mwa Maps","Open post":"Bula positi","Order print copy":"Laela khopi ye gatisizwe","Our Story | Shalom Embassy Ministries International":"Kale ka luna | Shalom Embassy Ministries International","Our Wednesday midweek service with Deliverance at 11:00 CAT and Preservation at 16:00 CAT — breaking yokes, ministering divine healing, and establishing spiritual preservation over your life and household.":"Misebezi ya luna ya Labulalu ya mwakati wa viki ni Kululamisa ka 11:00 CAT ni Kuboloka ka 16:00 CAT — ku loba majoko, ku fa kufolisa kwa Mulimu, ni ku tiisa kubolokwa kwa muya fa bupilo bwa hao ni lubasi lwa hao.","Our home in Lusaka":"Ndu ya luna kwa Lusaka","Our international headquarters is located at":"Ofisi ye nkulu ya luna ya lifasi kaufela i fumaneha kwa","Our mandate":"Mosebezi wo lu filwe","Our mandate is simple: that every person who walks through these doors would leave":"Mosebezi wo lu filwe u li bunolo: kuli mutu kaufela ya kenang ka minyako ye a ta zwa","Our mission":"Mosebezi wa luna","Our monthly empowerment service on the first Sunday of every month — a full day of worship, the Word, and prayer for every area of your life.":"Misebezi ya luna ya kufa maata ya kweli ni kweli ka Sundaya ya pele ya kweli ni kweli — lizazi kaufela la kulotuza, Lizwi, ni kupupa kwa likalulo kaufela za bupilo bwa hao.","Our monthly healing and deliverance service: seven hours of Spirit-led worship, the teaching of God's Word, prophetic prayer, healing, and deliverance for the whole family.":"Misebezi ya luna ya kufolisa ni kululamisa ya kweli ni kweli: lihora ze 7 za kulotuza ko eteledwa ki Muya, kuluta Lizwi la Mulimu, kupupa kwa kupolofeta, kufolisa, ni kululamisa kwa lubasi kaufela.","Our monthly worship encounter on the first Friday of every month — a night of deep worship, ministration, and encounter with the presence of God.":"Mukopano wa luna wa kulotuza wa kweli ni kweli ka Labutanu ya pele ya kweli ni kweli — busihu bwa kulotuza ka ku zama, ku sebeza, ni ku kopana ni Mulimu.","Our quarterly gathering of the whole church family for a full day of worship, the Word, prophetic prayer, healing, and deliverance.":"Mukopano wa luna wa likweli tatu wa lubasi kaufela lwa kereke kwa lizazi kaufela la kulotuza, Lizwi, kupupa kwa kupolofeta, kufolisa, ni kululamisa.","Our story":"Kale ka luna","Our vision":"Pono ya luna","Our weekly gatherings.":"Mikopano ya luna ya viki ni viki.","Our weekly rhythm and monthly encounters, laid out so you can plan ahead. All times are Central Africa Time (CAT).":"Mukwa wa luna wa viki ni viki ni mikopano ya kweli ni kweli, ze lukisizwe kuli u luke kwapili. Nako kaufela ki nako ya Afrika ya Mwakati (CAT).","Outreach & welfare":"Misebezi ya ku kalima ni ku thusa","Parking is available within and around the church premises at Plot 995, Garden House. Our ushers and protocol team will direct you as soon as you arrive. For directions, call":"Mabaka a ku paka a fumaneha mwa ntata ni kwa ntanda ya sibaka sa kereke kwa Plot 995, Garden House. Batu ba luna ba ku amuhela ni sikwata sa bona ba ta u bontsha mukwa ka nako ye u fitileng. Kwa mukwa, biza","Partner regularly with Standing In The Gap, Virtuous Women rural outreach, and village church planting across Zambia.":"Kopana ka nako kaufela ni Standing In The Gap, ku kalima kwa batu kwa mwahae kwa Basali ba Likutezo, ni ku yaha kereke kwa minzi mwa Zambia kaufela.","Partner with what God is doing.":"Kopana ni se Mulimu a se ezang.","Pastor Bupe":"Mubusisi Bupe","Pastor Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe":"Mubusisi Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe","Pastor Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe is a seasoned teacher of the Word whom the Lord has raised in this generation to bring out the counsel of God with clarity and grace. She is the visionary and founder of the":"Mubusisi Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe ki muluti ya nang le bukale wa Lizwi, yao Mulena a mu zusize mwa lukupo lo kuli a bontshe mwa kupeta wa Mulimu ka ku bwañi ni ka sishemo. Ki yena muboni wa pono ni mubupi wa","Pastor Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe leading Virtuous Women Ministry":"Mubusisi Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe a eteleda Misebezi ya Basali ba Likutezo","Pastor Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe — Co-Founder of Shalom Embassy and President of Virtuous Women Ministry":"Mubusisi Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe — Mubupi-hamoho wa Shalom Embassy ni Puresidente wa Misebezi ya Basali ba Likutezo","Pastor Bupe YouTube":"Mubusisi Bupe YouTube","Pastor Bupe and Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe":"Mubusisi Bupe ni Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe","Pastor Bupe on YouTube":"Mubusisi Bupe kwa YouTube","Phone or email":"Foni kamba imeili","Phone, WhatsApp & Friday Overnights":"Foni, WhatsApp ni Busihu bwa Labutanu","Plan a visit":"Lukisa lwendo","Plan your visit":"Lukisa lwendo lwa hao","Plot 995 · Garden House, Mumbwa Rd":"Plot 995 · Garden House, Mumbwa Rd","Plot 995, Garden House, Lusaka":"Plot 995, Garden House, Lusaka","Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road":"Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road","Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road, Behind Livonia Shopping Complex (Behind Garden House Hotel), Lusaka, Zambia":"Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road, Behind Livonia Shopping Complex (Behind Garden House Hotel), Lusaka, Zambia","Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road, Behind Livonia Shopping Complex, Lusaka":"Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road, Behind Livonia Shopping Complex, Lusaka","Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road, Behind Livonia Shopping Complex, Lusaka, Zambia":"Plot 995, Garden House, Off Mumbwa Road, Behind Livonia Shopping Complex, Lusaka, Zambia","Power of God — Part 2":"Maata a Mulimu — Karolo 2","Power of God — Part 2 message with Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe":"Mulumo wa Maata a Mulimu — Karolo 2 ni Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe","Practical information to help you plan your visit to Shalom Embassy Headquarters.":"Makande a ku thusa kuli u luke lwendo lwa hao kwa Ofisi ye Nkulu ya Shalom Embassy.","Practical, Christ-centred teaching that you can live out beyond Sunday.":"Maluto a ku sebisa a mi ka Kreste ao u ka a pila ku fita Sundaya.","Pray with me":"Upupe ni na","Prayer":"Kupupa","Prayer & Fasting Sunday":"Sundaya ya Kupupa ni Ku Itima Lico","Prayer & Fasting Sunday Service":"Misebezi ya Sundaya ya Kupupa ni Ku Itima Lico","Prayer & Intercession":"Kupupa ni Ku Kopela Batu","Prayer and Fasting Sunday Service":"Misebezi ya Sundaya ya Kupupa ni Ku Itima Lico","Prayer for your need":"Kupupa kwa litabelo za hao","Prayer line":"Mola wa Kupupa","Prayer line & office":"Mola wa Kupupa ni Ofisi","Prayer line: +260 974 807 770":"Mola wa Kupupa: +260 974 807 770","Prayer night":"Busihu bwa Kupupa","Previous month":"Kweli ye fitile","Previous photo":"Sifanyiso sa pili","Primary navigation":"Mukwa wa pili wa ku fetela","Proclaiming the unconditional love of Jesus Christ through prayer, the teaching of God's Word, healing, and deliverance across Zambia and the nations.":"Ku kalima lato le le sa beki mabaka la Jesu Kreste ka kupupa, kuluta Lizwi la Mulimu, kufolisa, ni kululamisa mwa Zambia kaufela ni kwa linaha.","Published books and prayer guides by Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe and Pastor Bupe Sinyangwe are available in print at the church bookshop in Lusaka, via WhatsApp on":"Libuka ni buku za kupupa ze gatisizwe ki Mutumwa Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe ni Mubusisi Bupe Sinyangwe li fumaneha ka ku gatiša kwa sibaka sa ku rekisa libuka sa kereke kwa Lusaka, ka WhatsApp kwa","Published by Shalom Embassy & Standing In The Gap":"Ye gatisizwe ki Shalom Embassy & Standing In The Gap","Published devotionals, spiritual warfare manuals, and quarterly Jubilee Prayer Books authored by Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe and Pastor Bupe Sinyangwe.":"Libuka za kupupa za zazi ni zazi, libuka za ndwa ya muya, ni Libuka za Kupupa za Jubilee za likweli tatu ze ñolilwe ki Mutumwa Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe ni Mubusisi Bupe Sinyangwe.","Published in Lusaka by the Standing In The Gap Team, this 73-page prayer and consecration volume equips watchmen and intercessors to guard their personal altar, contend for national revival, and keep the fire of the Holy Spirit burning without compromise.":"Ye gatisizwe kwa Lusaka ki Sikwata sa Standing In The Gap, buka ye ya mapeji a 73 ya kupupa ni ku ineela Mulimu i fa balebeli ni bakopeli maata a ku lebela aletare ya bona, ku lwanela ku zusa naha, ni ku boloka mubulo wa Muya o Kenile u tuka ka ku sa tima.","Quarterly":"Likweli tatu","Quarterly & annual prayer manual":"Buka ya kupupa ya likweli tatu ni ya silimo","Quarterly · Big Sunday 07:00 — 14:00":"Likweli tatu · Sundaya ye Nkulu 07:00 — 14:00","Raising young men and women who know God, walk in purity, and live with purpose through Youth Services, Battle Axe Conference, and ROAR.":"Ku holisa bashimani ni basizani ba ba ziba Mulimu, ba ba zamaya ka bukenile, ni ba ba pila ka maikemisetso ka Misebezi ya Bashimani, Battle Axe Conference, ni ROAR.","Read on Selar":"Bala kwa Selar","Read our story":"Bala kale ka luna","Recent":"Za pili","Recent highlights":"Lika za pili ze nde","Request details":"Kopa makande","Request from office":"Kopa kwa ofisi","Rooted in peace.":"Zamizwe ka kutula.","Rooted in the Word. Led by the Spirit.":"Zamizwe ka Lizwi. Eteledwa ki Muya.","Salvation":"Puluso","Salvation is by grace through faith in Jesus Christ alone — His death, burial, and resurrection.":"Puluso i fiwa ka sishemo sa Mulimu ka tumelo kwa Jesu Kreste feela — lifu la Hae, ku bepwa, ni ku zuha ha Hae.","Scripture":"Mañolo","Scripture rightly taught, practically applied, and reverently obeyed.":"Mañolo a kulutwa ka ku luka, a sebeliswa ka ku swanela, mi a latelelwa ka buisapi.","Search by title, speaker, or series...":"Batla ka libizo, mubuleli, kamba mukoloko...","Search the library":"Batla mwa laiburari","See all gatherings":"Bona mikopano kaufela","See church calendar":"Bona kalenda ya kereke","See deliverance services":"Bona misebezi ya kululamisa","See gatherings":"Bona mikopano","Selar":"Selar","Select language":"Keta puo","Send a message":"Lumela mulumo","Send a prayer request or book order":"Lumela kopo ya kupupa kamba ku laela buka","Send via WhatsApp":"Lumela ka WhatsApp","Sermon library":"Laiburari ya maluto","Sermon library & publications":"Laiburari ya maluto ni likwalo ze gatisizwe","Sermons":"Maluto","Sermons & Messages | Shalom Embassy Ministries International":"Maluto ni Mulumo | Shalom Embassy Ministries International","Serve with us":"Sebeleza ni luna","Service details":"Makande a misebezi","Service times":"Nako za misebezi","Seventeen years of God's faithfulness.":"Lisilimo ze 17 za tumelo ya Mulimu.","Shalom":"Shalom","Shalom Embassy 17th anniversary celebration":"Mukiti wa ku keteka lisilimo ze 17 za Shalom Embassy","Shalom Embassy Ministries International":"Shalom Embassy Ministries International","Shalom Embassy Ministries International was founded on":"Shalom Embassy Ministries International i bupiwa ka","Shalom Embassy Ministries International | Nothing Missing. Nothing Broken.":"Shalom Embassy Ministries International | Ha ku na se si siyo. Ha ku na se si bukile.","Shalom Embassy Ministries International. All rights reserved.":"Shalom Embassy Ministries International. Likwalo kaufela li bolokilwe.","Shalom Embassy at a glance":"Shalom Embassy ka ku bona fela","Shalom Embassy photo":"Sifanyiso sa Shalom Embassy","Shalom Library & Standing In The Gap":"Shalom Library & Standing In The Gap","Shalom TV":"Shalom TV","Shalom TV YouTube":"Shalom TV YouTube","Shalom TV on YouTube":"Shalom TV kwa YouTube","Shalom Worship & Children":"Kulotuza kwa Shalom ni Bana","Shepherds after God's heart.":"Balisana ba ba latelela pilu ya Mulimu.","Skip to content":"Fita kwa litaba","Sound biblical teaching & discipleship":"Maluto a nde a Bibele ni kuluta balutiwa","Sow a seed":"Jala peu","Sow toward the church building fund, Shalom TV broadcast equipment, and special ministry projects at Plot 995, Garden House, and our branch churches.":"Jala kwa mali a ku yaha kereke, lika za ku hasa za Shalom TV, ni misebezi ye iketilwe ya kereke kwa Plot 995, Garden House, ni kwa makereke a luna a makalulo.","Spirit-led worship":"Kulotuza ko eteledwa ki Muya","Spiritual heritage":"Lifa la muya","Spiritual heritage & apostolic covering":"Lifa la muya ni kubabalelwa kwa butumwa","Stake Your Claim":"Kopa se u se swanela","Standing In The Gap":"Standing In The Gap","Standing In The Gap & branch expansion":"Standing In The Gap ni ku atisa makalulo","Standing In The Gap Prayer Line":"Mola wa Kupupa wa Standing In The Gap","Standing In The Gap national intercession":"Kupupa kwa naha kaufela kwa Standing In The Gap","Stream live services and messages":"Bona misebezi ni mulumo ye i pila ka intaneti","Strong families.":"Malapa a maata.","Structured daily Bible reading plan":"Mulukuluku wa ku bala Bibele wa zazi ni zazi","Sun Mon Tue Wed Thu Fri Sat":"Sundaya Mubulo Labubeli Labulalu Labune Labutanu Labukweli","Sunday":"Sundaya","Sunday & midweek services":"Misebezi ya Sundaya ni ya mwakati wa viki","Sunday Monday Tuesday Wednesday Thursday Friday Saturday":"Sundaya Mubulo Labubeli Labulalu Labune Labutanu Labukweli","Sunday is better with you in the room.":"Sundaya i nde hahulu ha u li mwa sibaka.","Sunday worship":"Kulotuza kwa Sundaya","Sunday worship at Shalom Embassy":"Kulotuza kwa Sundaya kwa Shalom Embassy","Sunday · 7 Hours, Big Sunday & Empowerment Sunday":"Sundaya · Lihora ze 7, Sundaya ye Nkulu ni Sundaya ya Kufa Maata","Supporting weekly gatherings, teaching, worship, and the spiritual growth of the family.":"Ku thusa mikopano ya viki ni viki, maluto, kulotuza, ni ku hula kwa muya kwa lubasi.","Taking the message beyond Lusaka through streaming, media, and digital ministry.":"Ku isa mulumo ku fita Lusaka ka ku hasa, media, ni misebezi ya dijitala.","Talk to us":"Bulela ni luna","Targeted daily prayer points":"Mabaka a kupupa a zazi ni zazi","Teaching":"Maluto","Telegram":"Telegram","Tell us you are coming and we will look out for you. Our team can help with directions, seating, and any questions you have before you arrive.":"Lu bulele kuli u ta taha, mi lu ta u lebeza. Sikwata sa luna si ka thusa ka mukwa, mabaka a ku ina, ni lipuzo kaufela ze u nang le zona pele u fita.","Thank you":"Ni itumezi","The Anointing":"Kutozwa","The Bible":"Bibele","The Church":"Kereke","The Church is the family of God, called to love, serve, make disciples, and carry the Gospel to the nations.":"Kereke ki lubasi lwa Mulimu, ye bizizwe ku lata, ku sebeza, ku eza balutiwa, ni ku isa Litaba ze Nde kwa linaha.","The Dangers of Stealing":"Likotsi za Ku Uza","The Holy Spirit":"Muya o Kenile","The Holy Spirit empowers, gifts, and guides every believer for holy living and fruitful service.":"Muya o Kenile u fa maata, u fa limpo, mi u eteleda mulumeli kaufela kwa bupilo bo bu kenile ni ku sebeza ka ku tisa muselo.","The Scriptures are the inspired, infallible Word of God and our final authority for faith and life.":"Mañolo ki Lizwi la Mulimu le le fuluhilwe ki Muya, le le sa siyeleli, mi ki mulao wa luna wa mafelelezo wa tumelo ni bupilo.","The Shalom Embassy congregation gathered in the main auditorium in Lusaka":"Sikwata sa Shalom Embassy se kopaneng mwa holo ye nkulu kwa Lusaka","The Shalom Embassy congregation listening to the Word":"Sikwata sa Shalom Embassy se mamelanga Lizwi","The Shalom Embassy family standing in worship":"Lubasi lwa Shalom Embassy lu yemi mwa kulota","The Shalom Embassy main auditorium":"Holo ye nkulu ya Shalom Embassy","The Shalom Embassy main auditorium during a gathering":"Holo ye nkulu ya Shalom Embassy ka nako ya mukopano","The Shalom Embassy main auditorium during a service":"Holo ye nkulu ya Shalom Embassy ka nako ya misebezi","The Shalom Embassy main auditorium in Lusaka":"Holo ye nkulu ya Shalom Embassy kwa Lusaka","The Standing In The Gap prayer network contends for families and the nation through overnight vigils and dry fasts, while branches are planted across Mtendere, Mandevu, Matero, Foxdale, Chibombo, and rural villages across Zambia.":"Mukwale wa mipupo wa Standing In The Gap u lwanela malubasi ni sicaba ka mipupo ya busihu ni kuitima lico ni mezi, mwa nako yeo makalulo a calilwe kwa Mtendere, Mandevu, Matero, Foxdale, Chibombo ni mikwakwa ya mwa naha kaufela mwa Zambia.","The Wisdom of God":"Butali bwa Mulimu","The Word":"Lizwi","The Word & worship":"Lizwi ni Kulota","The Word never stops.":"Lizwi la Mulimu ha li kemi.","The Word with clarity":"Lizwi ka mukwa o utwahala","The Year of Keeping The Fire Burning":"Silimo sa ku Sunga Mulilo u Tuka","The commission that governs our teaching, intercession, and outreach across Zambia.":"Mosebezi wo lu lumezwi o o laolanga kuluta, kupupela ni ku fitela batu mwa Zambia kaufela.","The congregation standing in worship":"Sikwata se yemi mwa kulota","The family daily devotion and spiritual warfare guide of Shalom Embassy and the Standing In The Gap prayer network—including":"Buka ya kupupa ya lizazi ni lizazi ya lubasi ni ya ntwa ya moya ya Shalom Embassy ni mukwale wa mipupo wa Standing In The Gap—e kenyeleza","The journey":"Lwendo","The ministry's motto,":"Polelo ya mosebezi,","The month at a glance.":"Kweli ka ku bonabona.","The newest images and moments from our social channels.":"Lifoto ni lika ze nca ze ezahezi ze zwa kwa mapeji a luna a inthanete.","The next generation":"Sizazi se latela","The next generation at the Battle Axe Youth Ministry":"Sizazi se latela kwa Battle Axe Youth Ministry","There is a place for you here.":"Ku na ni sibaka sa hao kwano.","There is a place for you in this family.":"Ku na ni sibaka sa hao mwa lubasi lu.","There is a rhythm to life at Shalom Embassy — worship, the Word, prayer, and waiting on God together. Find your place in the family.":"Bupilo kwa Shalom Embassy bu na ni mukwa wa buna — kulota, Lizwi, kupupa ni ku lindela Mulimu hamoho. Fumana sibaka sa hao mwa lubasi.","These are the convictions that anchor our faith and shape our life together.":"Ze ki lika ze lu dumelang ka ku tiya, ze tiisanga tumelo yesu ni ku bopa bupilo bwesu hamoho.","This week at Shalom":"Viki ye kwa Shalom","This week at Shalom Embassy":"Viki ye kwa Shalom Embassy","Throughout the week":"Mwa viki kaufela","Thursday":"Labune","Thursday · Healing & Deliverance 18:00":"Labune · Kufolisa ni Kululamisa 18:00","TikTok":"TikTok","Tithes & offerings":"Bulishumi ni limpo","To proclaim the unconditional love of Jesus Christ through prayer and teaching God's Word, bringing deliverance, healing, and restoration to those who are oppressed.":"Ku taluseza lato lwa mahala lwa Jesu Kreste ka kupupa ni kuluta Lizwi la Mulimu, ku tisa kululamisa, kufolisa ni kubuyisa kwa ba ba nyandiswa.","To raise an army of men, women, youths, and children equipped with the right knowledge of God, spiritual warfare, soul-winning, and godly character, supported by humanitarian and charitable outreach.":"Ku hulisa sikwata sa masole sa banna, basali, bashimani ni bana, se lubekilwe ka kuziba Mulimu ka mukwa o nde, ntwa ya moya, ku hula batu kwa Mulimu ni mikwa ye nde ya Mulimu, se tusilwe ki misebezi ya thuso ni ya lusa kwa batu.","Today":"Kacenu","Together with The Standing In The Gap Team Prayer Ministry and Virtuous Women Ministry, we are commissioned to preach the full Gospel of Jesus Christ, take deliverance to the captives, and equip believers to fulfil their destinies in the Lord.":"Hamoho ni Standing In The Gap Team Prayer Ministry ni Misebezi ya Basali ba Likutezo, lu lumezwi ku luta Litaba ze Nde kaufela za Jesu Kreste, ku isa kululamisa kwa bakozi ni ku lubeka balumeli kuli ba phelele mafelelezo a bona mwa Mulena.","Tuesday · Virtuous Women 14:00":"Labubeli · Basali ba Likutezo 14:00","Upcoming":"Ze tla","View full book jacket":"Bona siboniso sa buka kaufela","Virtuous Women":"Basali ba Likutezo","Virtuous Women Ministry":"Misebezi ya Basali ba Likutezo","Visit":"Etela","Visit YouTube channel":"Etela tshaneli ya YouTube","Visit us":"Lu etele","Watch":"Bona","Watch & grow":"Bona ni ku hula","Watch Don't Stagger at His Promise":"Bona: U Si Ke Wa Tetema ka Sepiso ya Hae","Watch Healing and Deliverance Service":"Bona Misebezi ya Kufolisa ni Kululamisa","Watch Miracle Service":"Bona Misebezi ya Limakazo","Watch My Worship My Weapon 3.0":"Bona My Worship My Weapon 3.0","Watch My Worship My Weapon 3.0 on YouTube":"Bona My Worship My Weapon 3.0 kwa YouTube","Watch Night of Freedom":"Bona Busihu bwa Tukuluho","Watch Night of Solution":"Bona Busihu bwa Kululamisa","Watch Night of Solution on YouTube":"Bona Busihu bwa Kululamisa kwa YouTube","Watch Open Heaven — Part 1":"Bona Mahalimu a Bulehile — Karolo 1","Watch Power of God — Part 2":"Bona Maata a Mulimu — Karolo 2","Watch Power of God — Part 2 on YouTube":"Bona Maata a Mulimu — Karolo 2 kwa YouTube","Watch Prayer and Fasting Sunday Service":"Bona Misebezi ya Sundaya ya Kupupa ni Kuitima Lico","Watch Stake Your Claim":"Bona: Kopa Sika sa Hao","Watch The Dangers of Stealing":"Bona Bumaswe bwa Ku Uzwa","Watch Will You Not Revive Us Again":"Bona: Kana U Ta Lu Matafaza Hape","Watch a message":"Bona mulaelo","Watch anniversary messages":"Bona milaelo ya ku ikumbuka","Watch message":"Bona mulaelo","Watch on YouTube":"Bona kwa YouTube","Watch online":"Bona kwa inthanete","Watch testimony":"Bona bupaki","Watch the replay":"Bona hape","Ways to give":"Njila za ku fa","We are commissioned to preach the Gospel to the poor, heal the brokenhearted, proclaim liberty to the captives, and set at liberty those who are bruised—equipping believers for spiritual warfare, soul-winning, and godly character.":"Lu lumezwi ku luta babotana Litaba ze Nde, ku folisa ba lipilu ze lobehile, ku taluseza bakozi za tukuluho ni ku lukulula ba ba nyandiswa—lu lubeka balumeli kwa ntwa ya moya, ku hula batu kwa Mulimu ni mikwa ye nde ya Mulimu.","We are committed to handling every gift with honesty, accountability, and reverence. If you would like to know more about how giving is used, or you need help completing a gift, please speak with the church office. Thank you for sowing into what God is doing at Shalom Embassy.":"Lu ikemisitse ku sebeza ni mpo kaufela ka butataata, ka ku ikarabella ni ka kutompa. Ha u batla ku ziba hande kuli limpo li sebeliswa cwani, kamba u batla thuso ya ku fela mpo, buka ni ofisi ya kereke. Lu ku lumba ha u cala mwa sika seo Mulimu a se ezanga kwa Shalom Embassy.","We are here for you":"Lu inzi kwano ka mina","We believe in one God eternally existing in three persons: Father, Son, and Holy Spirit.":"Lu dumela mwa Mulimu a li mungi yo a pila ka nako kaufela mwa batu ba batatu: Ndate, Mwana ni Muya o Kenile.","We make room for the presence of God through heartfelt, joyful worship.":"Lu bulela sibaka sa bukona bwa Mulimu ka kulota kwa pilu ni tabo.","We saved you a seat":"Lu ku boloketse sibaka sa ku ina.","We would love":"Lu ka taba","Wed 11:00 & 16:00 Midweek · 21:00 — 04:00 Night of Solution · Thu 18:00 Healing & Deliverance":"Labulalu 11:00 ni 16:00 Mwakati wa Viki · 21:00 — 04:00 Busihu bwa Kululamisa · Labune 18:00 Kufolisa ni Kululamisa","Wed 11:00 & 16:00 · 21:00 — 04:00 · Thu 18:00 CAT":"Labulalu 11:00 ni 16:00 · 21:00 — 04:00 · Labune 18:00 CAT","Wednesday":"Labulalu","Wednesday & Thursday":"Labulalu ni Labune","Wednesday & Thursday · Midweek, Night of Solution & Healing":"Labulalu ni Labune · Mwakati wa Viki, Busihu bwa Kululamisa ni Kufolisa","Wednesday Night":"Busihu bwa Labulalu","Wednesday · Midweek 11:00 & 16:00 · Night of Solution 21:00":"Labulalu · Mwakati wa Viki 11:00 ni 16:00 · Busihu bwa Kululamisa 21:00","Weekly gatherings":"Mikopano ya viki ni viki","Welcome home":"Wa amuhelwa kwa hae","Welcome to Shalom Embassy Ministries International, a home of healing and deliverance proclaiming the unconditional love of Jesus Christ through prayer, the Word, and the power of the Holy Spirit.":"Wa amuhelwa kwa Shalom Embassy Ministries International, ndu ya kufolisa ni kululamisa ye e bolelang lato lwa mahala lwa Jesu Kreste ka kupupa, Lizwi ni maata a Muya o Kenile.","What are the Sunday and midweek service times?":"Ki nako ini ya misebezi ya Sundaya ni ya mwakati wa viki?","What is this about?":"Ye e bulela ka cwani?","What to expect.":"Se u ka se lindela.","What we believe":"Se lu dumelang","What we carry":"Se lu nesang","WhatsApp":"WhatsApp","When the Word of Christ is preached through a sanctified vessel, the Holy Spirit confirms it with salvation, healing, and deliverance. In this teaching from the main auditorium in Lusaka, Apostle Sunday Sinyangwe calls believers to walk in purity and demonstrate the living power of God.":"Nako ye Lizwi la Kreste li bolelwa ka sikwalo se kenilwe, Muya o Kenile u li tiisa ka puluso, kufolisa ni kululamisa. Mwa thuto ye e zwa kwa holo ye nkulu ya Lusaka, Mutumwa Sunday Sinyangwe u bizanga balumeli ku pila ka bupilo bo bu kenile ni ku bonisa maata a Mulimu a pila.","When we gather.":"Nako ye lu kopanang.","Where do I park and who can help me on arrival?":"Ni paka kai, mi ki mang ya ka ni thusa ha ni fita?","Where exactly is the church located?":"Kereke i kwa kai hande?","Whether you are visiting for the first time or looking for a church home in Lusaka, we look forward to welcoming you at Shalom Embassy Headquarters.":"Kapa u etela ka nako ya pele kamba u batla ndu ya kereke kwa Lusaka, lu lindele ku ku amuhela kwa Shalom Embassy Headquarters.","Whether you have a question, a prayer request, or you are planning your first visit, our team is here to help.":"Kapa u na ni potso, kopo ya kupupa, kamba u luka lwendo lwa hao lwa pele, sikwata sa luna se inzi kwano ku thusa.","Whole people.":"Batu ba felelezi.","Wholeness":"Bufelelezi","Wholeness & Freedom":"Bufelelezi ni Tukuluho","Will You Not Revive Us Again":"Kana U Ta Lu Matafaza Hape","With Morning Glory prayers Monday to Saturday, Wednesday midweek services, Thursday healing and deliverance, monthly 7-hour healing and deliverance encounters, quarterly Big Sunday gatherings, published prayer books, and over 294,000 followers online, Shalom Embassy continues to equip believers to fulfil their God-given destiny.":"Ka mipupo ya Kanya ya Meso ku zwa Mubulo ku fita Labukweli, misebezi ya mwakati wa viki ka Labulalu, kufolisa ni kululamisa ka Labune, mikopano ya kufolisa ni kululamisa ya lihora ze 7 kweli ni kweli, mikopano ya Sundaya ye Nkulu ya likweli tatu ni tatu, libuka za mipupo ze hasiwe, ni balateleli ba fita 294,000 kwa inthanete, Shalom Embassy i sa nze i lubeka balumeli kuli ba phelele mafelelezo a bona a ba filwe ki Mulimu.","Women's Ministry · Tuesdays 14:00":"Misebezi ya Basali · Labubeli 14:00","Word encounter & revelational teaching":"Mukopano wa Lizwi ni thuto ya mbululelo","Worship":"Kulota","Worship & Next Generation":"Kulota ni Sizazi se Latela","Worship encounter":"Mukopano wa Kulota","Worship leader ministering at Shalom Embassy":"Muetapeleli wa Kulota a sebeza kwa Shalom Embassy","Worship that makes room":"Kulota ku bulelanga sibaka","Worship that makes room for God":"Kulota ku bulelanga Mulimu sibaka","X":"X","Years of ministry":"Lilimo za mosebezi","Yes. Our Children's Ministry and Battle Axe Youth Ministry provide dedicated teaching, discipleship, and fellowship for children, teenagers, and university students.":"Ina. Misebezi ya luna ya Bana ni Battle Axe Youth Ministry i fa bana, bashimani ni baithuti ba yunivesiti thuto ye iketulelang, kuluta balutiwa ni mukopano.","Yes. Our gatherings are streamed live on":"Ina. Mikopano yesu i boniswa ka pila kwa","You don't need to have it all together. Come as you are — we will meet you where you are.":"Ha u swaneli ku ba ni lika kaufela ze lulamile. Tla ka mukwa o li — lu ka ku fumana kwa u inzi.","YouTube":"YouTube","YouTube channel":"Tshaneli ya YouTube","Young people at the Battle Axe Youth Ministry":"Bashimani kwa Battle Axe Youth Ministry","Young people at the Battle Axe Youth Ministry in Lusaka":"Bashimani kwa Battle Axe Youth Ministry kwa Lusaka","Young people worshipping together":"Bashimani ba lota hamoho","Your first Sunday, made simple.":"Sundaya ya hao ya pele, e ezizwe ku ba bonolo.","Your generosity at work":"Lusa lwa hao lu sebeza","Your giving helps us create space for worship, care for people, and carry the message beyond our walls.":"Kufa kwa hao ku lu thusa ku bulela sibaka sa kulota, ku swalela batu pilu ni ku isa mulaelo kwa mafelelezo a mabota a luna.","Your message":"Mulaelo wa hao","Your name":"Libizo la hao","Your questions, answered.":"Mipotso ya hao, i arabilwe.","Your seed matters more than you know.":"Peu ya hao i na ni butokwa ku fita mo u ziba.","Your tithes, offerings, and kingdom partnership advance the work of the Gospel at Shalom Embassy Headquarters in Lusaka and across our 21+ branch churches in Zambia.":"Bulishumi bwa hao, limpo za hao ni kopano ya hao ya mubuso i isa kwapili mosebezi wa Litaba ze Nde kwa Shalom Embassy Headquarters kwa Lusaka ni kwa mikereke yesu ya makalulo ye fita 21+ mwa Zambia.","Youth & Campus":"Bashimani ni Yunivesiti","anchor the soul.":"i tiisa moya.","and":"ni","and anchored in Judges 6:24:":"mi e tiilwe mwa Judges 6:24:","and quarterly editions. Each day provides a Prayer Focus, Power Point, Scriptures to Stand On, Devotion, Declaration of the Day, and Prayer Points.":"ni mikalo ya likweli tatu ni tatu. Lizazi ni lizazi li fa Kutalimela kwa Kupupa, Nto ya Maata, Mangolo a ku Yema ka One, Kuitukisela Mulimu, Polelo ya Lizazi ni Linto za Kupupa.","and visionary founder of the":"ni mubupi yo na ni mbonelo wa","by Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe and Pastor Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe in Lusaka, Zambia. After faithfully serving in one Pentecostal denomination for seventeen years, they were released by God to establish a ministry in Lusaka's Kanyama area with a clear commission: to preach the full Gospel, heal the brokenhearted, and bring deliverance to those who are oppressed.":"ki Mutumwa Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe ni Mubusisi Bupe Lumbwa Sinyangwe kwa Lusaka, Zambia. Ka mura ba sebelezi ka busepahali mwa kereke ya Pentekoste i li ng'wi ka lilimo ze 17, Mulimu a ba tokola ku yaha mosebezi kwa sibaka sa Kanyama kwa Lusaka ka tumelelo ye bonala: ku luta Litaba ze Nde kaufela, ku folisa ba lipilu ze lobehile ni ku tisa kululamisa kwa ba ba nyandiswa.","e.g. Chanda Mwale":"ka mukwa o li: Chanda Mwale","for details.":"kuli u zibe makande kaufela.","is drawn from the Hebrew meaning of":"i zwa kwa taliso ya Siheberu ya","on YouTube":"kwa YouTube","or":"kamba","over 21 branches":"makalulo a fita 21","planted across Lusaka, rural villages, and other parts of Zambia. In March 2026, the Shalom Embassy family celebrated 17 years of God's faithfulness, healing, deliverance, and transformed lives.":"a calilwe kwa Lusaka, mikwakwa ya mwa naha ni mabaka a mañwi a Zambia. Ka March 2026, lubasi lwa Shalom Embassy lu ketekile lilimo ze 17 za busepahali bwa Mulimu, kufolisa, kululamisa ni mipilo ye fetuhile.","post":"positi","series,":"mukalelo,","sermon library":"laiburari ya milaelo","to meet you.":"ku ku kopana.","whole":"felelezi","worship.":"kulota.","© OpenStreetMap contributors":"© OpenStreetMap contributors","— nothing missing, nothing broken.":"— ha ku na sika se si si teng, ha ku na sika se pihilweng.","—one of the largest women's ministries in Zambia, focused on raising a Spirit-filled army of watchmen and incubating every woman to reach her greatest potential.":"—o li mungi wa misebezi ye nkulu ya basali mwa Zambia, o talimela ku hulisa sikwata sa masole sa balebeli ba tletseng Muya ni ku holisa musali ni musali kuli a fite kwa maata a hae a mahulu.","—one of the largest women's ministries in Zambia, raising a Spirit-filled army of watchmen and equipping every woman to reach her God-given potential. Alongside teaching the Word at Shalom Embassy Headquarters, she leads outreach to vulnerable women and girls and supports church planting across rural communities in Zambia.":"—o li mungi wa misebezi ye nkulu ya basali mwa Zambia, o hulisa sikwata sa masole sa balebeli ba tletseng Muya ni ku lubeka musali ni musali kuli a fite kwa maata a hae a ba filwe ki Mulimu. Hamoho ni kuluta Lizwi kwa Shalom Embassy Headquarters, u etangela ku fitela basali ni basizana ba ba se na thuso ni ku thusa ku cala mikereke mwa mikwakwa ya mwa naha ya Zambia.","“Every man according as he purposeth in his heart, so let him give; not grudgingly, or of necessity: for God loveth a cheerful giver.”":"“Hakulicwalo, yo muñwi ni yo muñwi a fe sina mw'a hupulezi, isiñi ka ku honona kamba ku hapelezwa, kakuli Mulimu u lata ya fana ka tabo.”","“Nothing missing, nothing broken,”":"“Ha ku na sika se si si teng, ha ku na sika se pihilweng,”","“Nothing missing. Nothing broken.” — Judges 6:24":"“Ha ku na sika se si si teng. Ha ku na sika se pihilweng.” — Judges 6:24","“Proclaim It” faith confession":"“Taluseza Yona” buipaki bwa tumelo","“The Spirit of the Lord is upon me, because he hath anointed me to preach the gospel to the poor...”":"“Moya wa Mulena u fahalimw'a ka, kakuli u ni ketile ku luta babotana Litaba ze Nde...”","“Then Gideon built an altar there unto the LORD, and called it Jehovah-shalom.”":"“Cwale Gidioni a yahela Muñ'a Bupilo katala hona fo, mi a ka biza libizo la ‘Jehovah-shalom.’”","“When Christ is lifted high in a life and in a house, multitudes are drawn, yokes are broken, and no life leaves the same.”":"“Nako ye Kreste a phahamisizwe hahulu mwa bupilo ni mwa ndu, batu ba bañata ba hulelwa, lijoko li pihilwa, mi ha ku na bupilo bo bu zwang bu sa fetuha.”","“When the spirit of a believer is educated by the Word and partnered with the Holy Spirit, destiny is fulfilled without limitation.”":"“Nako ye moya wa mulumeli u lutwa ki Lizwi ni ku sebeza hamoho ni Muya o Kenile, mafelelezo a phelela ka ku se na sitiso.”","Every Last Sunday · 7 Hours 07:00 — 14:00":"Sundaya ya mafelelezo a kweli ni kweli · Lihola ze 7 07:00 — 14:00","Every Last Sunday 07:00 — 14:00 CAT · Wednesdays 11:00, 16:00 & 21:00 CAT · Thursdays 18:00 CAT":"Sundaya ya mafelelezo a kweli ni kweli 07:00 — 14:00 CAT · Labulalu ni Labulalu 11:00, 16:00 ni 21:00 CAT · Labune ni Labune 18:00 CAT","Every Last Sunday 07:00 — 14:00 · Big Sunday quarterly 07:00 — 14:00 · Empowerment Sunday 07:00 — 14:00":"Sundaya ya mafelelezo a kweli ni kweli 07:00 — 14:00 · Sundaya ye Nkulu nako ni nako ya likweli tatu 07:00 — 14:00 · Sundaya ya Kufa Maata 07:00 — 14:00","Days":"Mazazi","Hours":"Lihola","Mins":"Miniti","Secs":"Masekendi","Updated from YouTube & church channels":"E cwalehisizwe ku zwa kwa YouTube ni chaneli za kereke","Loading sermon library…":"Ku lwisa laiburari ya milaetsa…","No messages match that search yet. Try another title, speaker, or category.":"Ha ku na milaetsa ye e swana ni kubatla kuo kwa nako ye. Leka sehlooho se si ñwi, mubuleli yo muñwi, kamba kalulo ye ñwi.","All messages shown":"Milaetsa kaufela e bontsizwe","Latest upload":"Se zusizwe sa pili","Message":"Mulaetsa","Messages":"Milaetsa","Archive":"Sibulukelo","Church feed":"Litaba za kereke","Latest from Shalom Embassy":"Za pili ku zwa kwa Shalom Embassy","{n} messages in library":"Milaetsa ye {n} mwa laiburari","Load {n} more messages":"Lwisa milaetsa ye {n} ye ñwi","Update":"Cwalehiso","Gallery":"Lifoto","Open menu":"Bula menyu","Close menu":"Kwala menyu","Monday":"Mubulo","Tuesday":"Labubeli","Friday":"Labutanu","Saturday":"Labukweli","Sun":"Sundaya","Mon":"Mubulo","Tue":"Labubeli","Wed":"Labulalu","Thu":"Labune","Fri":"Labutanu","Sat":"Labukweli","January":"Januari","February":"Februari","March":"Machi","April":"Epreli","May":"Mei","June":"Juni","July":"Julai","August":"Agusti","September":"Setemba","October":"Oktoba","November":"Novemba","December":"Disemba","Share your prayer request or question here...":"Ngola kopo ya hao ya kupupa kapa potso kwanu mono...","Prayer request":"Kopo ya kupupa","First-time visit":"Lwendo lwa pele","Counselling":"Kufa likezo","Partnership":"Kopano","Giving":"Kufa","General enquiry":"Potso ye kamuhelo","Official giving account details.":"Likutezo za akaunti ya kufa ye li fumaneha.","Use any of the verified channels below. Please include “Tithe” or “Offering” as your reference where possible.":"Sebelisa likalulo ze li fumaneha kaufela. Kena “Sankomelo” kapa “Moneelo” sina sesupo.","Bank transfer":"Kutumela ka banka","Mobile money":"Mali a fa foni","Email transfer":"Kutumela ka imeili","Account number":"Nambala ya akaunti","Account name":"Libizo la akaunti","Mobile number":"Nambala ya foni","Email address":"Imeili","Copy":"Kopa","Copied":"Ku kopilwe","Use your full name as the transfer reference.":"Sebelisa libizo la hao kaufela sina sesupo.","These are the official tithes and offerings accounts of Shalom Embassy Ministries International. If you need help completing a gift, please contact the church office.":"Zena ki akaunti za sankomelo ni moneelo za Shalom Embassy Ministries International. Ha u batla thuso ya ku fela moneelo, buka ofisi ya kereke.","See account details":"Bona likutezo za akaunti","Indo Zambia Bank (IZB) logo":"Logo ya Indo Zambia Bank (IZB)","Airtel Money logo":"Logo ya Airtel Money","MTN Mobile Money logo":"Logo ya MTN Mobile Money","Zelle logo":"Logo ya Zelle","Key moments":"Nako za Butokwa","Moments that marked the season.":"Nako ze ziswetilize nako.","Revisit the encounters, celebrations, and moves of God that defined this chapter of our story.":"Kutela kwa mikopano, likunutu, ni misebezi ya Mulimu ye e bopile karolo ye ya taba yaka ya luna.","Celebration":"Likunutu","The next special services and monthly encounters in the life of the house.":"Mikopano ye e taha ya butokwa ni ya kweli ni kweli mwa bupilo bwa kereke.","Full church calendar":"Kalenda kaufela ya kereke","The Shalom Library":"Laiburari ya Shalom","Every book. Every prayer. One place.":"Buka kaufela. Kupupa kaufela. Sihala se sili.","A verified collection of the books and prayer manuals published by Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe and Pastor Bupe Sinyangwe, with a quiet reading room for Everyday With The Holy Spirit.":"Mukoloko o netefalizwe wa libuka ni libuka za kupupa ze ngotilwe ki Apostle Dr. Sunday Sinyangwe ni Pastor Bupe Sinyangwe, ni sibaka sa kubala sa Everyday With The Holy Spirit.","The story of the library.":"Kamukanda wa laiburari.","A shelf built by the Word.":"Sihala se ahilwe ki Lizwi.","What began as discipleship notes and prayer guides for the Shalom Embassy family is now a published library serving believers across Zambia and the nations.":"Ze ne li zingolwa za kuluta ni libuka za kupupa kwa lubasi lwa Shalom Embassy, kacenu ki laiburari ye ngotilwe ye sebeza balumeli mu Zambia ni mwa linaha.","Jubilee Prayer Book · October–December":"Jubilee Prayer Book · Oktoba–Disemba","The October–December edition is published as a daily devotion and spiritual-warfare guide.":"Khatiso ya Oktoba–Disemba i ngotilwe sina buka ya zazi ni zazi ni kiba sa ntoa ya moya.","Jubilee Prayer Book · January–March & July–September":"Jubilee Prayer Book · Januari–Machi & Julai–Setemba","The series continues quarterly, including Executing Judgment on the Spirit of Jezebel.":"Mukoloko u t'atamela ka likota ze li sila, ku kenyelleza Executing Judgment on the Spirit of Jezebel.","A 73-page intercession and consecration volume is published in Lusaka by the Standing In The Gap Team.":"Buka ya mapeji a 73 ya kupupa ni boineeli i ngotilwe mu Lusaka ki Sipato sa Standing In The Gap.","The daily devotional is released on Selar, inviting believers into deeper fellowship with the Holy Spirit.":"Buka ya zazi ni zazi i fumisizwe kwa Selar, i bizwa balumeli kwa bukamboni bo tezi ni Moya o Muyapeli.","A deliverance and spiritual-warfare manual is released on Selar.":"Buka ya kulukula ni ntoa ya moya i fumisizwe kwa Selar.","The library continues to grow.":"Laiburari i t'atamela ku hula.","Print copies are available at the church bookshop, and digital editions are available on Selar.":"Libuka ze printilwe li ba kwa sitolo ya libuka ya kereke, mi libuka za inthaneti li ba kwa Selar.","Also in the library":"Hape mwa laiburari","Workings of the Holy Spirit & Enter Jubilee By Fire":"Workings of the Holy Spirit & Enter Jubilee By Fire","These titles are part of the wider Shalom Library. Ask the church office for current print and digital availability.":"Libuka ze li mwa Laiburari ya Shalom ye kana. Buza ofisi ya kereke ka taba ya ku fumana ka printa ni inthaneti.","The reading room":"Nda ya kubala","Read Everyday With The Holy Spirit.":"Bala Everyday With The Holy Spirit.","Open a sample day from the devotional, then continue in the complete edition on Selar or collect a print copy at the church bookshop.":"Bula zazi ze li sample mwa buka, mi u t'atamele mwa buka kaufela kwa Selar nji u nke buka ya printa kwa sitolo ya libuka ya kereke.","Sample reading":"Kubala kwa sample","Day 1":"Zazi 1","Theme":"Mukwa","Word Encounter":"Kopana ni Lizwi","Prayer Point":"Kupupa","Proclaim It":"Bulela","Daily Bible Reading":"Kubala Baibele zazi ni zazi","The Person of the Holy Spirit":"Mutu wa Moya o Muyapeli","The Holy Spirit is not a force to be managed; He is a Person to be known. Jesus promised Another Comforter who would abide with us forever, teach us all things, and lead us into truth.":"Moya o Muyapeli ha se matla a ku laolwa; ki Mutu ya swanelwa ku zibiwa. Jesu a bukile Mwafwilisi yo muñwi ya ka pila ni luna ka ku yoya, a ka luuta zinto kaufela, mi a ka lupepa kwa niti.","Before you open the Word today, become quiet. Acknowledge the Holy Spirit. Invite Him to illuminate the Scriptures and to make His presence real in your home, your work, and your walk.":"Mwa nako ye u sa ka bula Lizwi kacenu, ku ziba. Amuhe Moya o Muyapeli. Mu mu meme kuli a bonese Mañolo ni ku eza ku ba teng'a hae ka niti mwa ndu ya hao, mwa mushumo wa hao, ni mwa ku zamaya kwa hao.","Read John 14:16–17 slowly. Notice the words abide, teach, and lead. Let them become a prayer.":"Bala Johane 14:16–17 ka bukuku. Lebelela mazwi a kuli pila, luta, ni kupepa. U li ke e be thapelo.","Holy Spirit, teach me to know You as a Person, not only as a power.":"Moya o Muyapeli, n'uta ku ku ziba sina Mutu, e sili feela matla.","The Holy Spirit lives in me, leads me, and teaches me all things.":"Moya o Muyapeli u pila mwa na, u n'ta, mi u n'uta zinto kaufela.","Sample reading. The complete daily devotional is available on Selar and in print.":"Kubala kwa sample. Buka kaufela ya zazi ni zazi i ba kwa Selar ni kwa printa.","Library":"Laiburari","The complete collection.":"Mukoloko kaufela.","Every title we can verify in the public bookshop and church library. Out-of-print editions can be requested from the office.":"Libuka kaufela ze lu ka netefaliza mwa sitolo ya libuka ya batu kaufela ni laiburari ya kereke. Likhatiso ze sa ngotiwanga hape li ka kopiwa kwa ofisi."};
